1
00:00:12,303 --> 00:00:15,181
Seung‑hyun.

2
00:00:15,181 --> 00:00:19,436
Ah, so is he the player
you mentioned?

3
00:00:22,585 --> 00:00:25,588
What brings you here
this late, Seung-hyun?

4
00:00:27,569 --> 00:00:28,528
I was just...

5
00:00:28,528 --> 00:00:29,904
Nice to meet you.

6
00:00:29,904 --> 00:00:31,740
I'm Jeong‑min Lee.

7
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:35,827
Seung-hyun Park.

8
00:00:36,828 --> 00:00:39,164
Jeong-min, it's late.

9
00:00:39,164 --> 00:00:40,290
Let's talk again later.

10
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:41,875
Yeah, I get it, Ji-sung.

11
00:00:41,875 --> 00:00:44,878
No rush on the decision.

12
00:00:44,878 --> 00:00:48,298
Guess I'll be dropping by
more often now.

13
00:00:48,298 --> 00:00:51,301
Later, Ji-sung.

14
00:00:55,346 --> 00:00:57,454
Do you want to
step outside for a sec?

15
00:01:00,977 --> 00:01:03,980
So... what brought you here?

16
00:01:04,939 --> 00:01:07,192
I was just curious
what you were up to.

17
00:01:07,192 --> 00:01:08,485
At this hour?

18
00:01:09,027 --> 00:01:11,821
That guy...

19
00:01:11,821 --> 00:01:14,824
Jeong‑min Lee's
a pro player.

20
00:01:15,492 --> 00:01:18,495
He came to offer me
a private rehab position.

21
00:01:18,745 --> 00:01:22,665
So... are you leaving?

22
00:01:22,665 --> 00:01:24,459
Nothing's been decided yet.

23
00:01:24,459 --> 00:01:26,544
I hope you don't go.

24
00:01:32,467 --> 00:01:33,510
Why?

25
00:01:33,510 --> 00:01:35,386
Huh?

26
00:01:35,386 --> 00:01:38,473
Well, it's been going well
with you, and I don't want...

27
00:01:38,473 --> 00:01:39,891
Don't worry

28
00:01:41,559 --> 00:01:44,270
Seung-hyun.

29
00:01:44,687 --> 00:01:47,690
You really think
I'd just leave you behind?
